<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,268.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,268.</headline>
<text>
<p>Spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,268 today from 1,256 on Oct 25, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route			   Index    Rate    Prev Index  Rate</p>
