<p>   2   US GULF/JAPAN	1640    23.429    1640    23.429</p>
<p>   2a  SKAW P/USG/F EAST  1567 12850.000    1563 12821.000</p>
<p>   3   NOPAC/JAPAN	  1379    12.721    1374    12.679</p>
